  This project is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0,
  but the verbatim licence text is not included here yet. A licence only
  works if the text is exact, so it must be copied from the source rather
  than retyped.

  Easiest route (one click, and it also makes GitHub display the licence
  badge correctly):

      In the new repo on GitHub:
      Add file -> Create new file -> name it "LICENSE"
      -> "Choose a license template" -> GNU Affero General Public License v3.0

  Or from the command line:

      curl -o LICENSE https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt

